{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The collapse of Gensokyo... it was you, Reimu - &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eTouhou Danmaku Kagura Phantasia Lost\u300fis a Touhou Project officially approved derivative rhythm action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes are available: the Story Mode, in which you can solve the mysteries of the destroyed Gensokyo through the Danmaku Kagura (rhythm game), and the Free Mode, in which you can play the rhythm game to your heart's content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a total of 171 songs, including 68 songs from the main product and 103 additional songs distributed as four DLCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Experiences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kagura Stage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode you hit the notes at the right moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stack up combos and get a high score by hitting the notes consecutively coming through the 6 lanes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/0cfe5f30a029e9992c08e28ca3ca2e4e.poster.avif?t=1759834746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/0cfe5f30a029e9992c08e28ca3ca2e4e.webm?t=1759834746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danmaku Stage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A totally new game experience that combines Danmaku shoot 'em up &amp; Rhythm games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions set for each stages and beat the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/0416877091b182cd224e7fe90321374e.poster.avif?t=1759834746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/0416877091b182cd224e7fe90321374e.webm?t=1759834746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/0416877091b182cd224e7fe90321374e.mp4?t=1759834746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizability to tune your rhythm experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the notes' speed, adjust the location of the combo display,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >change the notes' design, change all you want to give you a stress-free rhythm experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/a7f3ef2ca585e4d2b3f4763036bd58f4.avif?t=1759834746\" width=600 height=298 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring over 80 characters from Touhou Project. Characters are animated with Live2D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/263098c08458d7d7292575d5da9d08c7.avif?t=1759834746\" width=600 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/b6ddfbb0484e434c6229c8acd2e61f03.poster.avif?t=1759834746\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/b6ddfbb0484e434c6229c8acd2e61f03.webm?t=1759834746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/b6ddfbb0484e434c6229c8acd2e61f03.mp4?t=1759834746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful illustrations to color your game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 Mitama cards available to obtain through the progression of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing artists such as Yuu Kamiya (No Game No Life), Negi Haruba (The Quintessential Quintuplets), and many more have contributed to producing the fantastic works!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/5dd5fc21bc18439b32ebfaf554e4d48d.avif?t=1759834746\" width=600 height=336 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/91cd9bf435f1e000c5eb3041edb3c0cd.avif?t=1759834746\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The only game where you can play Touhou Project Original Songs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside many songs from the Touhou Project games, songs such as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;U.N. Owen Was Hero?&quot; by Toby Fox &amp; ZUN were written for this game! Accessible from Free Update. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[ Touhou Project Originals included in the base game ]</strong><br>Phantom Band ~ Phantom Ensemble  <br>Hartmann's Youkai Girl   <br>Border of Life   <br>U.N. Owen Was Her?   <br>Crimson Belvedere ~ Eastern Dream...   <br>Reach for the Moon, Immortal Smoke   <br>Pure Furies ~ Whereabouts of the Heart </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[ Touhou Project Originals included in the Paid DLCs ]</strong><br>DLC vol.1: Love-colored Master Spark  <br>DLC vol.2: Gensokyo Millennium ~ History of the Moon<br>DLC vol.3: The Shining Law of the Strong Eating the Weak  <br>DLC vol.4: Septette for a Dead Princess  <br>DLC vol.5: The Gensoukyou the Gods Loved <br>DLC vol.6: The World Is Made From Cuteness <br>DLC vol.7: Desire Drive <br>DLC vol.8: Maiden's Capriccio ~ Dream Battle <br>DLC vol.9: Entrust This World to Idols ~ Idolatrize World <br>DLC vol.10: A Soul as Scarlet as a Ground Cherry <br>DLC vol.11: Take Thy Danmaku In Hand, O Bulletphiles <br>DLC vol.12: Crazy Backup Dancers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[ Free Update ]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >U.N. Owen Was Hero? -\u00a0Toby Fox &amp; ZUN<br>Beneath the Purple Cherry Blossoms Once Again - Collab with &quot;Touhou Mystia's Izakaya&quot;<br>Farewell Tour -\u00a0 Collab with &quot;Hifuu Club Activity Record&quot;<br>Flawless Clothing of the Celestials (not)innocent?-\u00a0Collab with the Three-Piece Band &quot;fh\u00e1na&quot;<br>Megalovania of the Empty Corse - arranged by ZUN<br>Necrolovania - arranged by Toby Fox<br>Help me, ERINNNNNN!! - beatMARIO<br>Maware Gensou Festival - Theme song of Hakurei Jinja Reitaisai<br>Yurikago no Uta -\u00a0Collab with &quot;Marisa of Liartop Mountain&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190220/extras/d974def287ceac30416757152cf6412d.avif?t=1759834746\" width=598 height=426 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mitama Card Collection I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190220/895b7579fd01a196ad116c7232745563e122f199.jpg"},{"name":"Mitama Card Collection II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/219022